<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective Jan 30.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     21.45     21.45	  5.58-10.93 5.58-10.93</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     21.45     21.45	  5.39-10.41 5.39-10.41</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     25.66     25.03	  12.44	12.89</p>
<p> White sugar	  25.66     25.03	  7.88	 8.20</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.26	0.25	  0.39	 0.40</p>
</text>
